--- !u!114 &1990189337
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1990189336}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 627c1c2bfea08a54997d89f353dc3858, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  setEvents:
    events:
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 1990189336}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 7096670327494543431, guid: 1189e97e912249f40a9ba9cf596f1aea, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: Now you need to collect scroll before taking the quiz
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins:
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 2135737537}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1370542151}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1100687129}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
      setEmotes:
        emotions:
        - player: 0
          character: {fileID: 1990189336}
          emotes: 0
          duration: 0
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 2
      interval: 0
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 1990189336}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 0}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: Magandang araw, Bayani! Ngayon ay sisimulan natin ang unang bahagi
            ng iyong paglalakbay sa El filibusterismo. Tatalakayin natin ang mahahalagang
            pangyayari mula Kabanata 1 hanggang 5
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins: []
      setEmotes:
        emotions: []
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 0
      interval: 0
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 1990189336}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 0}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: Good day, class!
        - characterObj: {fileID: 1990189336}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 0}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: "Today, we are going to talk about a very interesting and important
            topic \u2014 the thematic analysis of Chapters 1 to 5 of Noli Me Tangere.
            This lesson is important because it helps us understand not only the
            story, but also the social issues and historical realities that Rizal
            wanted to expose during his time"
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins:
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 2135737537}
          direction: 1
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1370542151}
          direction: 1
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1100687129}
          direction: 1
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1100687129}
          direction: 2
          walk: 0
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
      setEmotes:
        emotions: []
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 1
      interval: 1
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 1990189336}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 7096670327494543431, guid: 1189e97e912249f40a9ba9cf596f1aea, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: Sa bahaging ito ng El Filibusterismo, nasaksihan natin ang wakas
            ng paghihiganti ni Simoun at ang kanyang pagbabalik-loob sa kabutihan.
            Dito ipinakita ni Rizal na ang tunay na hustisya ay hindi makakamtan
            sa pamamagitan ng galit, kundi sa kapatawaran at pananampalataya.
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins:
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 2135737537}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1370542151}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 1100687129}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
      setEmotes:
        emotions: []
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 0
      interval: 0
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 1990189336}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 4146786208365501868, guid: e0fc78612fd72bb47962291c54c64a6e, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 1
          line: Sa tagpong ito, ibinunyag ni Simoun na siya ay si Crisostomo Ibarra.
            Ito ay sandali ng kanyang pagkilala sa kabiguan ng poot at paghihiganti.
            Ang kanyang pag-amin ay sumisimbolo sa pagbabalik ng kanyang kaluluwa
            sa kabutihan at sa pagnanais ng kapatawaran sa Diyos at sa bayan.
        - characterObj: {fileID: 1990189336}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 1335385452945238478, guid: 4c0ec937426b5eb40a389480beda60f6, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 1
          line: Si Padre Florentino ay nagsilbing gabay at tinig ng moralidad. Sa
            kanyang mga salita, ipinahayag niya na ang tunay na pagbabago ay hindi
            nakukuha sa dahas, kundi sa kabutihan at pananampalataya.Ipinakita rin
            dito ni Rizal na ang simbahan, kung tunay na gagamitin sa kabutihan,
            ay maaaring maging gabay tungo sa kaliwanagan.
        - characterObj: {fileID: 1990189336}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 4633355498211079068, guid: b256c6a7b43509c41818c1f85193dcf2, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 1
          line: "Ang dagat sa huling kabanata ay nagiging saksi sa huling pag-asa
            ni Simoun at ng bansa. Nang ibuhos ni Padre Florentino ang mga alahas
            sa tubig, ito\u2019y naging simbolo ng paglilinis ng kasalanan, at pag-asa
            sa bagong umaga ng bayan. Ang dagat ay nagsilbing paalala na may bagong
            simula sa likod ng bawat kabiguan."
